---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Icons reGospeled — a gospel that heals">

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">More informed &amp; dignified theology and psychology</p>
      <h1>Rediscover a gospel that heals.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Many of us were handed a God who keeps score. Icons reGospeled helps the wounded and the curious rediscover a gospel that heals — through honest theology, psychology, and real community.</p>
      <div class="cta-row center">
        <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/reading-finder/">Find your book →</a>
        <a class="textlink" href="/course/">or take the course</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-alt" data-reveal>
    <div class="narrow" style="text-align:center;">
      <p class="eyebrow">If this is you</p>
      <h2>You love Christ, but the loudest version of faith started to feel like a threat.</h2>
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <p class="lead">You went looking for something both theologically serious <em>and</em> non-shaming, and couldn't find it. Underneath is the exhaustion, the disillusionment, and the quiet fear that maybe the problem is you.</p>
      <p>It isn't. Fear-based, shame-based religion has always struggled to tell the truth about a God who is, first and last, love. The gospel was supposed to be good news — a Physician, not a scorekeeper.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-reveal>
    <div class="wrap two-col">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">You're not crazy for wanting more</p>
        <h2>We've been the wounded and disillusioned too.</h2>
        <p>Icons reGospeled sits at the intersection of ancient theology, modern psychology, and relational presence. We read the Church Fathers and take the brain and the body seriously, because healing is a whole-person thing.</p>
        <p>There's a podcast, a course, a table you can actually pull up a chair to, and a curated library of the best restoration theology we know.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid cols-2">
        <div class="card"><div class="tag">Rooted in</div><h3>The Fathers</h3><p>Irenaeus, Athanasius, the Gregorys — theosis, Christus Victor, and the restoration of the image.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="tag">Honest about</div><h3>The Whole Person</h3><p>Psychology in service of healing — not to replace faith, but to help it land in the body.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="tag">Practiced at</div><h3>The Table</h3><p>Real gatherings where you can think out loud, tell the truth, and be welcomed.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="tag">Building</div><h3>A Library</h3><p>A curated path through grace, hell reframed, the Fathers, psychology, and contemplation.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-alt" data-reveal>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="text-align:center;">A clear path forward</p>
      <h2 style="text-align:center;">Four steps back to a gospel that heals</h2>
      <div class="rule center"></div>
      <div class="steps" style="margin-top:36px;">
        <div class="step"><div class="num">1</div><h3>Find your next book</h3><p>Answer three questions in the Book Finder and start reading where you actually are.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="num">2</div><h3>Join the conversation</h3><p>The podcast and the Substack — deeper, freer, more honest than you were taught to expect.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="num">3</div><h3>Come to the table</h3><p>Wings, Whiskey &amp; the Word and our other gatherings. Belong before you believe it all.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="num">4</div><h3>Go deeper</h3><p>The course, <em>The Gospel You Were Never Told</em> — the good news, all the way down.</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="lead" style="text-align:center;max-width:60ch;margin:32px auto 0;">Our promise: we won't shame you, rush you, or hand you slogans. We'll meet you with depth, honesty, and welcome.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-reveal>
    <div class="narrow" style="text-align:center;">
      <p class="eyebrow">What's at stake</p>
      <h2>You can stop managing your fear and start becoming a living icon again.</h2>
      <div class="rule center"></div>
      <p class="lead">The alternative is staying trapped in a faith that slowly crushes you — or walking away from Christ entirely because the only version you knew was toxic. There's another road: hearing the gospel as truly good news, the healing of the whole person, and a community that thinks deeply and loves well.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-alt" data-reveal>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="text-align:center;">Everything in one place</p>
      <h2 style="text-align:center;">Where to begin</h2>
      <div class="rule center"></div>
      <div class="grid cols-3" style="margin-top:36px;">
        <a class="card" href="/reading-finder/"><div class="tag">Free · start here</div><h3>The Book Finder</h3><p>Three questions, two books chosen for where you are, and a curated library of 60+ more.</p><span class="go">Find your book →</span></a>
        <a class="card" href="/podcast/"><div class="tag">Podcast</div><h3>Less Heresy Than Expected</h3><p>Warm, witty, theologically serious conversation for believers, doubters, and the disillusioned.</p><span class="go">Listen →</span></a>
        <a class="card" href="/course/"><div class="tag">Course · $20</div><h3>The Gospel You Were Never Told</h3><p>What if the Good News is actually better than you were told? Five sessions to find out.</p><span class="go">Take the course →</span></a>
        <a class="card" href="/community/"><div class="tag">Community</div><h3>Come to the table</h3><p>Wings, Whiskey &amp; the Word, Movies for Humans, retreats, and more.</p><span class="go">See gatherings →</span></a>
        <a class="card" href="https://strengthenedbygrace.substack.com/"><div class="tag">Substack</div><h3>Strengthened by Grace</h3><p>Theological reflection, gospel interpretation, and spiritual restoration — free to read.</p><span class="go">Subscribe →</span></a>
        <a class="card" href="/give/"><div class="tag">Support</div><h3>Give</h3><p>Help keep the table set and the library growing. Every gift furthers the work.</p><span class="go">Give →</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band" data-reveal>
    <div class="narrow">
      <h2>Come to the table.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Start with the book most likely to meet you where you are — free, and yours in about a minute.</p>
      <div class="cta-row center" style="margin-top:24px;">
        <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/reading-finder/">Find your book →</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/community/">Find a gathering</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
